name  Updraft
hint  The fan can lift water. Mind the door.
ink    560
target 530
par    10
hold   3

emitter 170 90   0 1   170 650 36

# floor on the left
chain 6   560 600   60 640
# the fan column, blowing up the face of the shelf
zone 600 150  154 540   450 -1500
# a high shelf with the cup
chain 6   760 260   760 380   1060 380   1060 120
goal      767 290   286 84
# the shelf's support, so water cannot sneak round the bottom
wall 760 380  760 700  6

# a door that slides across the top of the column
slide 150 0  2.6
  wall 590 215  690 215  7
end

solution 120 230  135 300  560 470
